		{
			description: [
				"kane@remus:~$ cat bat-adv.jv"
				"------------------------------"
				"A rechargeable battery, the extraction team found several on the persons of deceased researchers and tecnicians from Site Romulus. There were no traces of prints describing their creation, but also nothing to suggest they were created on-site. &lIt is possible other facilities may have these.&r"
			]
